menu "Blue Baton settings"

    config KM_WIFI_ENABLE
        bool "Enable Wi-Fi setup (only when switching to the server mode)"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, the board turns on Wi-Fi (board Wi-Fi + home Wi-Fi) and opens the settings API.
            Keep it off when the board is plugged into the main device over USB.
            If the main device joins the board's Wi-Fi, that device loses its internet connection.

    config KM_DIAG
        bool "Developer diagnostics (stats details, self-test)"
        default y
        help
            Per-host delivery statistics in the stats command (acknowledgement times, signal strength, reports the
            stack could not take, buffer use) and the selftest command. Turn off for release builds: the code is
            compiled out and stats keeps only the basic fields.

endmenu
